# ============================================================================
# SoyMutDB Portal (apps/web) — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# SPA fallback: removed the explicit `/* /index.html 200` catch-all
# (oracle review R7, 2026-08): Cloudflare Pages applies redirects BEFORE
# static-file matching in some configurations, which would shadow SSG HTML
# files (news/{slug}.html, about.html).  Pages' built-in SPA fallback
# (no top-level 404.html) already serves index.html for unknown paths.
# SSG content pages (ssg-content.ts) are real files and win over the
# built-in fallback.  Verify with a Preview deployment:
#   curl -sI https://<preview>/news/<slug>   (expect 200, text/html)
# ============================================================================
